#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:564
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BattleOurFamily"
msgid ""
"Hello! I take it you're a traveler.\p"
"How's this? What do you say to taking\n"
"on our family of four in a series of\l"
"POKéMON battles?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:570
msgctxt "Route111_Text_IsThatSo"
msgid ""
"Is that so?\n"
"Drop in, if you change your mind!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:574
msgctxt "Route111_Text_VictorIntro"
msgid "That's the spirit! I like you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:577
msgctxt "Route111_Text_VictorDefeat"
msgid ""
"Aiyah!\n"
"You're a lot tougher than I expected!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:581
msgctxt "Route111_Text_VictorPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Hey, all!\n"
"I've found a pretty strong TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:585
msgctxt "Route111_Text_VictoriaIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh, my goodness! Aren't you young?\p"
"You must be quite the TRAINER to beat\n"
"my husband, though.\p"
"It's my turn to battle now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:591
msgctxt "Route111_Text_VictoriaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, gosh!\n"
"I can't get over how strong you are!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:595
msgctxt "Route111_Text_VictoriaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There's a strong TRAINER here!\n"
"This one's really strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:599
msgctxt "Route111_Text_ViviIntro"
msgid ""
"You're stronger than Mommy? Wow!\p"
"But I'm strong, too!\n"
"Really! Honestly!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:604
msgctxt "Route111_Text_ViviDefeat"
msgid "Huh? Did I just lose?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:607
msgctxt "Route111_Text_ViviPostBattle"
msgid ""
"This stinks…\p"
"…Snivel… Grandma!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:611
msgctxt "Route111_Text_VickyIntro"
msgid ""
"How dare you make my granddaughter\n"
"cry!\p"
"For that, I'm going to smack you!\n"
"Prepare to lose!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:617
msgctxt "Route111_Text_VickyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Kwah! You are strong…\n"
"My granddaughter was right…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:621
msgctxt "Route111_Text_VickyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you're not in any hurry,\n"
"visit with us awhile.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:625
msgctxt "Route111_Text_ToughToKeepWinningUpTheRanks"
msgid ""
"If you don't raise your POKéMON some\n"
"more, it could be tough to keep winning\l"
"up through the ranks.\p"
"I've heard the POKéMON LEAGUE's\n"
"ELITE FOUR are far stronger than\l"
"any GYM LEADER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:633
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WinstrateFamilyDestroyedMe"
msgid ""
"I challenged the WINSTRATE family,\n"
"but four matches in a row is tough\l"
"going… They destroyed me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:638
msgctxt "Route111_Text_RouteSignMauville"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 111\n"
"{DOWN_ARROW} MAUVILLE CITY$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:642
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WinstrateHouseSign"
msgid ""
"“Our family's hearts beat as one!”\n"
"THE WINSTRATE'S HOUSE$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:646
msgctxt "Route111_Text_RouteSign112"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 111\n"
"{LEFT_ARROW} ROUTE 112$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:650
msgctxt "Route111_Text_RouteSign113"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 111\n"
"{LEFT_ARROW} ROUTE 113$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:654
msgctxt "Route111_Text_OldLadysRestStopSign"
msgid ""
"OLD LADY'S REST STOP\n"
"“Come in and rest your tired bones.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:658
msgctxt "Route111_Text_TrainerTipsSpAtkSpDef"
msgid ""
"TRAINER TIPS\p"
"One of the indicators of a POKéMON's\n"
"powerfulness is SP. ATK. It stands for\l"
"“SPECIAL ATTACK.”\p"
"Likewise, SP. DEF stands for “SPECIAL\n"
"DEFENSE.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:666
msgctxt "Route111_Text_ShouldBeMirageTowerAroundHere"
msgid ""
"There should be a tower made of sand\n"
"around here somewhere.\p"
"But for some reason, it can be seen\n"
"sometimes, and sometimes not.\p"
"That's why I call it the MIRAGE TOWER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:673
msgctxt "Route111_Text_MirageTowerClearlyVisible"
msgid ""
"I see it!\n"
"The tower of sand!\p"
"The sand tower they called a mirage\n"
"is clearly visible!\p"
"But it looks so fragile…\n"
"It could crumble away anytime…\p"
"I want to go inside it, but I can't\n"
"get my courage up for it…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:683
msgctxt "Route111_Text_ThatWasShockingSandRainedDown"
msgid ""
"Whoa…\n"
"That was shocking.\p"
"Sand rained down in chunks all of\n"
"a sudden.\p"
"What was it like inside?\n"
"Were there sandy ghosts and such?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:691
msgctxt "Route111_Text_MirageTowerHasntBeenSeenSince"
msgid ""
"Since I spoke to you, the tower of sand\n"
"hasn't been seen.\p"
"Perhaps it really was\n"
"the MIRAGE TOWER…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:697
msgctxt "Route111_Text_ClawFossilDisappeared"
msgid ""
"The CLAW FOSSIL disappeared into\n"
"the sand…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:701
msgctxt "Route111_Text_RootFossilDisappeared"
msgid ""
"The ROOT FOSSIL disappeared into\n"
"the sand…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:705
msgctxt "Route111_Text_MauvilleUncleToldMeToTakeRockSmash"
msgid ""
"Oh, no!\p"
"My uncle in MAUVILLE told me to take\n"
"ROCK SMASH with me if I was going to\l"
"ROUTE 111!\p"
"My uncle? He lives across from\n"
"the bike shop in MAUVILLE.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc:713
msgctxt "Route111_Text_TrainerHillSign"
msgid ""
"{RIGHT_ARROW} TRAINER HILL ENTRANCE\p"
"“Scale the heights, you hot-blooded\n"
"TRAINERS!”$"
msgstr ""
